DESCRIPTION >
    Frozen safety decision for the current identity batch. Normal compaction only
    runs when this snapshot says no evidence removal can split a profile.

SCHEMA >
    `unsafe_fact_count` UInt64 `json:$.unsafe_fact_count`,
    `rebuild_reasons` Array(String) `json:$.rebuild_reasons[:]`,
    `rebuild_required` UInt8 `json:$.rebuild_required`,
    `checked_at` DateTime64(6) `json:$.checked_at`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY checked_at
